# Shared provider env (Netie Space + AirGPT)

Copy keys into:
- Netie: `.env` and/or `%LOCALAPPDATA%\NetieSpace\user.env`
- AirGPT: `D:\AirGPT\env.local`

```
# Free first
GOOGLE_AISTUDIO_FREE=
GOOGLE_API_KEY=

GROQ_API_KEY=
GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.1-8b-instant

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini

SEA_LION_API_KEY=
SEA_LION_MODEL=aisingapore/Qwen-SEA-LION-v4.5-27B-IT

# AirGPT-only (optional)
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
```

Netie also reads `SEA_LION_*` from the API Keys UI. Prefer one Google key name in both apps going forward (`GOOGLE_API_KEY` or `GOOGLE_AISTUDIO_FREE`).
